---
const phone = "010-8930-2266";
const kakaoUrl = "https://pf.kakao.com/_florixstudio";
---

<footer class="border-t border-border px-6 md:px-12 py-10 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-[12px] text-dim tracking-[0.08em]">
  <div>
    <div class="font-black tracking-[0.18em] text-sm text-text mb-3">
      FLORIX<span class="text-accent mx-1">.</span>STUDIO
    </div>
    <div>© 2026 FLORIX STUDIO. All rights reserved.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="md:text-center leading-[1.8]">
    플로릭스 스튜디오 · 콘크리트 폴리싱<br />
    TEL 010-8930-2266<br />
    contact@florixstudio.co.kr
  </div>
  <div class="md:text-right leading-[1.8]">
    전국 시공 · 24시간 상담<br />
    <a href="https://blog.naver.com/wlstjr49" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-text transition-colors">네이버 블로그</a> ·
    <a href="https://instagram.com/florix.studio" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-text transition-colors">Instagram</a>
  </div>
</footer>

<div class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 flex flex-col gap-3 z-50">
  <a
    href={kakaoUrl}
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener"
    aria-label="카카오톡 상담"
    class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-[#FEE500] flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
  >
    <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#1F1A14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <path d="M12 3C6.48 3 2 6.58 2 11c0 2.81 1.85 5.27 4.62 6.66l-1.13 4.15c-.1.37.31.66.62.45l4.97-3.28c.31.02.61.02.92.02 5.52 0 10-3.58 10-8S17.52 3 12 3z"/>
    </svg>
  </a>

  <a
    href={`tel:${phone.replace(/-/g, "")}`}
    aria-label="전화 상담"
    class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-text flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
  >
    <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#EFE7D8" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.37 1.9.72 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.35 1.85.59 2.81.72A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/>
    </svg>
  </a>
</div>
